<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<%- include('../partials/head', { title: title }) %>
<body class="bg-stone-50 text-stone-900 font-sans">
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>
  <main>

    <!-- ── 404 Page ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <!-- Req 1.6, 8.3 -->
    <section class="py-20 lg:py-32 flex items-center justify-center" aria-labelledby="notfound-heading">
      <div class="max-w-lg mx-auto px-4 text-center flex flex-col gap-6">

        <!-- 404 status (informative, in Bahasa Indonesia) -->
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-500">Halaman Tidak Ditemukan</p>

        <h1 id="notfound-heading" class="font-serif text-7xl lg:text-9xl font-bold text-stone-200 leading-none select-none" aria-hidden="true">
          404
        </h1>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 -mt-2">
          Halaman Tidak Tersedia
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm lg:text-base text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          Maaf, halaman yang Anda cari tidak dapat ditemukan. Mungkin alamatnya berubah,
          atau halaman tersebut sudah tidak tersedia. Coba kembali ke beranda dan telusuri dari sana.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center mt-2">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 min-h-[44px] text-sm font-semibold text-stone-50 bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-900 rounded transition-colors duration-150 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-stone-700 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
          >
            ← Kembali ke Beranda
          </a>
          <a
            href="/products"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 min-h-[44px] text-sm font-semibold text-stone-800 border border-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-100 rounded transition-colors duration-150 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-stone-700 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
          >
            Lihat Produk
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
